                <div class="hLv1Ctrl">
                    <h1 class="hLv1">Tokiwadai International Residence</h1>
                </div>
                <div id="contentInner">
                    <div class="fright frobject"><img src="/english/student/images/student_thumb01.jpg" alt="" width="350" height="239" /></div>
                    <p> Tokiwadai International Residence is a new housing complex which opened on March 2019. It is a new type of residence where students and researchers live together while promoting multicultural exchanges and mutual understanding among them.<br />In a Shared Unit, eight students from different nationality, class and college forms one unit, and lives together in a “shared house” type residence which includes a living room and a kitchen. Apart from this, a fully-private type room and researcher’s accommodation are also provided.<br>Both Shared-Units and Private Type Rooms are divided into men's and women's areas in the building.</p>
                    <dl class="des-short">
                        <dt>Eligibility</dt>
                        <dd>Students※ and international researchers of YNU<br>
                        ※Japanese students: except Research students, Accredited auditors and Auditors.<br>
                        International students: except Accredited auditors and Auditors.
                        </dd>
                        <dt>Tenancy</dt>
                        <dd>Students: Within 4 years for undergraduate student and 5 years for graduate student.<br /> Researchers: Within the period accepted as international researcher at YNU.</dd>
                        <dt>Rooms</dt>
                        <dd>Shared units for students: 112 (8 rooms/unit × 14 units)<br /> Private type rooms for students: 166<br /> Rooms for researchers: 21<br /> Barrier-free rooms: 4<br />
                            <p>&nbsp;</p>
                            Total Number of Rooms: 303
                        </dd>
                        <dt>Facilities</dt>
                        <dd>Day-shift managers (support available in Japanese & English), Management Office (open 365 days), Auto-locking system, Security camera, Elevators, Delivery locker, Bicycle parking (Free of charge), Motorbike parking (Monthly payment required), Lounge (1F), Laundromat, Vending machine</dd>
                    </dl>
                    <h2>Address / Nearest station</h2>
                    <dl class="des-short">
                        <dt>Address</dt>
                        <dd>79-9 Tokiwadai, Hodogaya-ku, Yokohama 240-0067 (On YNU Tokiwadai Campus)
                        </dd>
                        <dt>Nearest station</dt>
                        <dd>15-minute walk from Sotetsu Line “Wadamachi” station
                        </dd>
                    </dl>
                    <h2>Fees for Residents</h2>
                    <a name="acc-01" id="acc-01"> </a>
                    <h3>Shared Unit for Students: 112 rooms</h3>
                    <p class="important">※Management and operation of Tokiwadai International Residence are entrusted to Ichii Corporation. , Ltd<br /> For more information and application are here : Tokiwadai International Residence Website URL：<a href="https://tokiwadai-ir.jp/en/" target="_blank">https://tokiwadai-ir.jp/en/<img src="/common/images/for_ico_blank.gif" alt="新しいウィンドウが開きます" width="11" height="11"/></a></p>
